  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Nigeria, HIV, National Agency for the Control of AIDS (NACA)This program has the following goals: To end HIV epidemics by the year 2030. The objectives of this program are: To achieve 95-95-95 target by 2025.  To scale-up service among KPs, AGYWs and other vulnerable population</narrative>
  </description>
